+### shipOrder [orderId: OrderId] => void | error: String
+Marks a paid order as shipped and consumes its reserved inventory: each item's quantity is removed from reserved, available is unchanged. Fails if the order is not found, its status is not "paid", or reserved stock is insufficient.
